  "purpose": [
    "Define the canonical stage progression and per-stage readiness projection for Werewolf Character creation.",
    "Separate stage completion, review-required state, blocked capability state, and applicability state.",
    "Expose deterministic stage metadata for validation, review summary, and character sheet projection.",
    "Preserve current slice boundaries so unsupported or blocked capabilities cannot appear as available."
